note bottom of B04
Flow: Create once by stable key; claim with bounded lease; prevent live dual ownership; acknowledge then explicitly resolve; audit human action.
Guard: Closed incidents reject claim; another live owner causes conflict; home mismatch behaves as not found.
Status: Host complete; target pending
